  "name": "iroh-blobs",
  "description": "A high-performance content-addressed blob transfer protocol and storage implementation for the iroh network stack. It leverages BLAKE3-verified streaming via Bao to enable efficient range requests and incremental verification over QUIC. The crate provides both persistent (redb-backed) and in-memory storage backends with a robust tagging system for lifecycle management.",
